WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.694
Open the workspace with your personal
invitation.

00:00:03.694 --> 00:00:07.158
This session belongs to the platform
administrator.

00:00:08.208 --> 00:00:10.320
Harbor Lantern Foundation and Orchard

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.109
Table Collective each have a workspace.

00:00:13.109 --> 00:00:15.474
This directory shows their names.

00:00:15.474 --> 00:00:19.530
Their projects and contacts stay with their
own teams.

00:00:20.582 --> 00:00:23.778
Sign out to close the platform session.

00:00:23.778 --> 00:00:27.815
Returning to the workspace now requires a
fresh invitation.
